.vscode
.idea
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Testing
coverage
jest.config.*
jest.setup.*
__tests__
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*

# CI / misc
.github
.husky
README.md
LICENSE
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*

